// ── Not carried into PDL ──
// block noise: noise source (no noise module in the registry)
// block filter1: bandpass filter (VCF has LPF and HPF outputs only)
// block lfo1: random LFO (LFO has sine, triangle, saw, square outputs)
// block lfo2: random LFO (LFO has sine, triangle, saw, square outputs)
// audio ['noise', 'filter1']: edge from/to an unmapped block (noise → filter1)
